            "label": "hard coding values instead of using parameters creating substrings instead of using contains or indexOf, - 3 (very inefficient in terms of time and space) adding multiple instances of the same name, - 3(This came up when students nested one check inside of another. That is very slow and can result in multiple instances of the same name being added.",
            "points": 4
