        "prompt": "Implement a helper method for a binary tree class that returns true if the tree is full, false otherwise. Recall, our definition for a full binary tree is one in which every node is a leaf (no child nodes) or has 2 child nodes. For this question an empty binary tree is full binary tree. For this question, you may not add any helper methods.",
        "reference": "public class BinaryTree {\n\n       private BNode root; // root == null if tree is empty\n\n       // nested BNode class\n       private static class BNode {\n            private int data;\n            // left and right store null if no child exists on that side\n            private BNode left;\n            private BNode right;\n       }\n\n       public boolean isComplete() {\n            return helper(root);\n       }",
