        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -1 unless question allows partial credit. (Statements in parenthesis not required, only\nGrading notes: E: method simply sums up elements in array | G: Cannot instantiate abstract classes | K: minor differences in spacing and brackets okay | N: or words to that effect | O: base 2 okay",
