        "officialSolution": "Grading notes: A: +/- 1 on each term, must be log base 3 | B: Even though going from back, worst case is remove first half | F: Infinite loop okay, runtime error okay | I: try this 60, 10, 50, 20, 40, 30 | P: Or words to that effect. | T: D -> C -> B -> G -> F -> H | V: not the size of the hash table or number of elements. The iterator must look through all elements of the array.",
