        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -1 unless question allows partial credit. (Statements in parenthesis not required, only No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces.\nGrading notes: A: +/- 1 on each coefficient | B: +/- 0.5 on the N term, +/- 1 on the constant | H: quotes -2, minor differences in spacing and brackets okay | J: out of bounds error | M: cannot instantiate iterator | N: quotes -2, minor differences in spacing and brackets okay | O: calls remove twice in a row | P: 1 point if just 2, 1 point if just 3 | Q: cannot add int or Integer to list of Strings | S: 1 point each | T: 1 point if 1 and 2 | V: declared type Vacation, no days method in Vacation class or Object class | X: -1 if 1 and 2",
