        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. (Statements in parenthesis not required, only No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces.\nGrading notes: K: blank counted as wrong | L: size cross over | M: near best case insertion sort | N: base 2 okay, mergesort always NlogN | U: cannot add String when E is String[] | V: base 2 okay | Y: Stack overflow due to not hitting base case any time soon",
