        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and brace unless noted. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: E: diff in { okay | I: removing the last element of a singly linked list. Even with last reference, must update that reference to refer to second to the last node. | V: diff in { okay",
