        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and brace unless noted.\nGrading notes: J: +/- 1 each coefficient | M: 1 point each, -1 per other to 0 points",
