        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: A: range: +/- 0.5 on N, +/- 1 on the constant value | B: +/- 1 on each coefficient, no credit if an N^2 term included. | K: Cannot instantiate an object of type Comparable, an interface type. | O: Cannot add a StringBuilder object to an ArrayList<String>.",
