        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: B: StackOverflow error occurs | J: No partial credit | P: full credit if answer in range [1800, 2200] | S: The client may WANT all the values.",
