        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: B: +/- 2 on each coefficient | L: no partial credit | N: every path to a node could be a word | O: 10per leaf 1 per internal node | P: 1 point each | Q: 1 point each | X: H was given | Y: Just Taylor okay",
