        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: A: +/- 1 on each coefficient | B: +/- 1 on each coefficient, no credit if an N^2 term included. | I: uses least space, like our IntList but for chars. StringBuilder actually uses a byte[] as its internal con.s | J: Exception acceptable. A NoSuchElementException occurs due to a logic error. | N: The iterator remove still requires elements to be shifted in the underlying array. | U: Declared type is Book, Book does not have a material method. | Y: class cast exception",
