        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: B: +/- 1 on each coefficient allowed | D: ClassCastException | E: or infinite loop due to logic error in inner loop | S: OR V square root of E of course | Y: +2 points",
