        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer.\nGrading notes: A: range: +/- 1.0 on each coefficient | B: range: +/- 1.0 on each coefficient | G: must be 0.42 exactly | H: Removing the first half of the list. | M: only | R: declared type of vr is Vehicle. No recharged method in the Vehicle or Object classes. | X: No 0 arg constructor in Vehicle class. Lose default constructor if any constructors declared. | Y: Method in Vehicle class cannot access private instance variables of a Car object.",
