        "officialSolution": "Answer as shown or -2 unless question allows partial credit. No points off for minor differences in spacing, capitalization, commas, and braces. Text in parenthesis not required. It is simply grading guidance and / or a brief explanation for answer. 2 not required. No N term.) N. sorted\nGrading notes: B: +/- 1 on EACH coefficient allowed. base 2 not required. No N term. | I: with 10 internal nodes there will be 11 leaf nodes | K: base 3 okay | M: base 2 okay, Java PQ uses a min heap | Q: arrows to objects okay",
